{"id":"c9068a8f2385d816","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-prop-stochastic-integral.md","title":"Stochastic Integral Isometry","display":"prop-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral Isometry","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-stochastic-integral","aliases":["58-prop-stochastic-integral"],"display":"prop-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral Isometry","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-stochastic-integral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-stochastic-integral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-stochastic-integral — Stochastic Integral Isometry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44af585e6fa080e5\" href=\"?note=44af585e6fa080e5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md\">../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe4afc670ec37a7e\" href=\"?note=fe4afc670ec37a7e\" title=\"../batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md\">../batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>保留八元 <code>ItoIntegral_S</code> 和八元 <code>ItoIsometry_meta</code> 的名称、参数顺序；后者现由下式定义，不再是只在自然语言中说明的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b91a21e76d0947e0\" href=\"?note=b91a21e76d0947e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44af585e6fa080e5\" href=\"?note=44af585e6fa080e5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md\">../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}integral}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}integral}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>名称中的 meta 为兼容原调用而保留；该关系的内容已全部写入 Assertion。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"44af585e6fa080e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md","status":"resolved","id":"fe4afc670ec37a7e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-thm-ito-isometry.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}$、$\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}$、$\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"44af585e6fa080e5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-ito-integral.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}integral}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{ItoIntegral}_S(I,H,B,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{ItoIsometry}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,H,B,t;\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3996","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-prop-stochastic-integral.md|58-prop-stochastic-integral]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["44af585e6fa080e5","b91a21e76d0947e0","fe4afc670ec37a7e"]}